CORE smt-backend gcc-only no-new-smt
memset.c
--cvc5 --external-smt2-solver ./cvc5-wrapper.sh
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^VERIFICATION ERROR$
--
CBMC passes only --lang smtlib to a user-supplied cvc5 binary or wrapper, which
chooses its own options. This test is marked "gcc-only" as resolving ./ won't
work with Windows.
